    <statement><p>Find the average value of <m>f(x,y) = x^2 y</m> over the rectangle <m>R</m> with vertices <m>(-4,0), (-4,8), (2,8), (2,0).</m></p>
<p>Answer: <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\frac{8}{6\cdot \left(2--4\right)}\mathopen{}\left(2^{3}-\left(-4\right)^{3}\right)</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
